    {
      "ruleId": "LAW-MED-01",
      "category": "legal",
      "subcategory": "medical_claim",
      "title": "未经审批的医疗与治病宣称",
      "markets": ["*"],
      "jurisdiction": "US FDA/FTC · EU EC 1924/2006 · UK ASA · 日本《药机法》",
      "severity": "block",
      "action": "rewrite",
      "patterns": [
        "\\bcures?\\b|\\bcuring\\b",
        "\\btreat(s|ing|ment)?\\s+(disease|illness|infection|inflammation|pain|symptoms?|insomnia|fever)\\b",
        "\\bheal(s|ing)?\\s+(disease|illness|wounds?|organs?|inflammation)\\b",
        "\\bprevent(s|ing)?\\s+(cancer|disease|illness|infection|stroke|diabetes)\\b",
        "\\banti-?inflammatory\\b",
        "\\bboost(s|ing)?\\s+(your\\s+)?immunity\\b",
        "治療|治癒|完治|病気を治|抗炎症|免疫力を高め",
        "치료|완치|치유|질병\\s*예방|항염|면역력\\s*강화",
        "\\bcura(r|s|ndo)?\\s+(enfermedad|dolor|inflamaci)",
        "\\bantiinflamatori\\w*|fortalece\\w* el sistema inmune",
        "\\banti-?inflamat[oó]ri\\w*|fortalece\\w* a imunidade",
        "\\bheil(t|en|ung)?\\s+(krankheit|entzündung)|entzündungshemmend|stärkt das immunsystem",
        "\\bgu[ée]ri(t|r|sson)?\\b|anti-?inflammatoire|renforce\\w* l'immunit[ée]",
        "\\bлеч(ит|ить|ение)\\b|исцел\\w*|противовоспалительн\\w*|укрепл\\w* иммунитет"
      ],
      "zhCues": ["包治百病", "根治", "特效药", "预防癌症", "抗癌", "消炎杀菌", "治疗疾病"],
      "reason": "普通食品、饮品及日用品在欧美、日韩等海外市场严禁宣称治疗、治愈、预防疾病或抗炎等医疗功效，违反当地食药与广告法规。",
      "suggestion": "改写为口感、香气或日常舒缓体验描述，保留完整广告语境，不宣称医疗或治病效果。"
    },
    {
