        "\\bclears?\\s+(away\\s+)?(internal\\s+)?heat\\b|\\bheat-clearing\\b",
        "\\b(remov\\w*|expel\\w*|clear\\w*)\\s+dampness\\b|\\bdampness-(removing|clearing|expelling)\\b",
        "\\binternal\\s+heat\\b",
        "デトックス|解毒|排毒|清熱|除湿効果",
        "디톡스|해독|독소\\s*배출|청열|속열",
        "\\bdesintoxic\\w*|elimina\\w* el calor interno|elimina\\w* la humedad",
        "elimina\\w* o calor interno|elimina\\w* a umidade",
        "\\bentgift\\w*|leitet hitze ab|entfernt feuchtigkeit",
        "\\bd[ée]tox\\w*|\\bd[ée]sintox\\w*|chasse\\w* la chaleur|chasse\\w* l'humidit[ée]",
        "детокс\\w*|вывод\\w* токсин\\w*|внутренний жар|вывод\\w* сырость"
      ],
      "zhCues": [],
      "reason": "欧美、欧盟及日韩广告监管机构明确将未经 EFSA/FDA 批准的“detox（排毒）”“clears internal heat（清热解毒）”直译认定为违规健康宣称。",
      "suggestion": "切勿直接删减或掐断文案，请改写为“light, refreshing / cooling and soothing（清爽轻盈、清凉舒缓）”等合规的饮用体验表达。"
